{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act50side_level_act50side_05_beg","storyGroup":"act50side","storySort":10,"storyDependence":"act50side_level_act50side_04_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"TD-5","storyName":"只能成功，不能失败","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"面对兽潮，众人制定好应对策略，月见夜和空爆外出诱敌，梓兰和宝巫迦留守城内，一切看似顺利……","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act50side/level_act50side_05_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act50side_05","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":8,"next":10,"characters":["武士","宝巫迦","月见夜","梓兰","空爆","政宗","义经","斑弥罗"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/4c/Avg_bg_71_g1_impermanence_street.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"true","id":6},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$nervous_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_nervous_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":9},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2110_1#1$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":12},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"将军，陛下，你们终于回来了！","id":13,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2110_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":14},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"情况如何？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2110_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"启禀陛下！野兽还在源源不断地从“御轮”的方向涌来！它们……它们根本杀不完！","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2110_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2110_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":18},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"将军这些年建造的防线起到了作用，但是，被攻破恐怕是时间问题。","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2110_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"……辛苦了。传令下去，让他们再坚持一段时间，不能让防线崩溃，我和陛下会有办法。","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2110_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":22},{"type":"dialogue","name":"武士","text":"是！我们相信您和陛下！","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e5/Avg_avg_npc_2110_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":24},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":25},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":26},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":27},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"夸下海口，要是做不到该怎么办？","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"团队最重士气，有信心重于一切。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"说得轻巧，单纯的防守只是在用人命拖延时间，是慢性死亡。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":34},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"如今“雷之主”已经是兽潮的首领，空爆小姐说得没错，在确保都城安全的前提下，先将它杀死依然是最好的选择。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":36},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我明白你的意思，陛下。","id":37,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":38},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"但兽潮来势汹涌，我们必须先解决眼下的麻烦。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":40},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾会亲自带兵消灭兽潮，吾等狩猎之国的子民，死也应当死在狩猎之中。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"不可。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下或许可以杀十头，甚至百头野兽，但根据斥候的观察，兽潮源源不断。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"那你有什么办法？","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"……首先，我要说一个悲观的结论，想靠泡影国现在的力量正面抵挡兽潮恐怕是不可能的。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":50},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"若是再给我三十年准备，或许我能够培养出能够抵御这场兽潮的部队。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":52},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾知道，眼下的吾等，做不到正面抵挡。","id":53,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"没错，我们必须主动出击，将兽潮分流。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"怎么分？按你的说法，我们的兵力本就捉襟见肘，你这么做无异于将我们本就脆弱的防线一分为二。","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我明白你的顾虑，梓兰小姐。所以，这次行动并非强攻，而是智取。我们有一个……独一无二的诱饵。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#10$2","focus":"m","id":60},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"诱饵？","id":61,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-10$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":62},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"刚被我们讨伐的“异兽”熔火蜗，它的尸体。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"用它的尸体？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"没错。梓兰小姐，你们也见识过“诅咒”了。","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"那是一种不祥的能量，而被“诅咒”侵蚀的野兽，会本能地被更强大的“诅咒”源所吸引，如同飞蛾扑火。","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但是，宝巫迦不是已经把它的“诅咒”吸收了吗？","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/69/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾只是吸收了必要的能量来启动“御轮”……它身上的“诅咒”并未完全消除。","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"而它的尸体，对那些被“诅咒”侵染的野兽而言，是无法抗拒的“盛宴”。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":76},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"用狩猎对象来吸引狩猎对象，这倒是很符合猎人的风格喵。","id":77},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"但是，要把它们引到哪里去？在平原上，我们跑不过无穷无尽的兽潮喵。","id":79},{"type":"dialog","id":80},{"type":"charslot","id":81},{"type":"text","text":"月见夜的手指点在地图上的一处狭长地带，那里是都城外的竹林。","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":83},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"城东数里外，这片竹林的地表之下，有一片巨大的空洞，是古代地下河干涸后留下的遗迹。","id":84,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你是想……","id":86,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":87},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"没错。我们可以派一支精锐部队作为诱饵，用“异兽”熔火蜗的尸体，将兽潮的主力吸引至这片竹林，然后……","id":88,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"用斑弥罗特制的炸药，引爆地表，制造大规模塌陷，让它们掉下去，摔死它们。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"计策听来可行，但是……为什么这里有一处空洞，吾却全然不知？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"这里……","id":94},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$4","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":96},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"等等喵，这不是前代陛下——","id":97},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":98},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"……没错，这处空洞，正是“雷之主”的巢穴。","id":99,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……？！","id":101,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a3/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":102},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这正是陛下这些年遍历周围都没法找到“雷之主”巢穴的原因。","id":103,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":104},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我本不愿意将此处告诉陛下，但是，事急从权。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":106},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"由吾亲自去。","id":107,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"“异兽”熔火蜗是吾狩猎的，它身上的“诅咒”与吾的巫女之力有所感应，由吾拖动尸体，吸引的效果最好。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":110},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"恕我……无法遵命，陛下。","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/42/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"月见夜！吾乃一国之主，亦是泡影国最强的猎人之一！","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":114},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"难道说，到了现在你还担心吾会因为冲动而去挑战“雷之主”吗？","id":115,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/27/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":116},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"过去十年，无论“雷之主”暗中在做什么，它没有为我们带来灭顶之灾。","id":117,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":118},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"这给了我们安宁的时间。","id":119,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":120},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"哪怕这份安宁是屈辱的，只要它是安宁，我就愿意死守它，为此，被认为懦弱也好，保守也罢，我都无所谓。","id":121,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"但是，只有一点我希望您能相信我，这些年来，我做的一切，都是为了给您铺好杀死“雷之主”的道路。","id":123,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"只是，我们现在还不知道“雷之主”究竟如何引发了这场异变。","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":126},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"还不是时候。","id":127,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":128},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"这句话吾已经听过太多遍了，究竟什么时候才是对的时候？","id":129,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":130},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"为什么你总是想要为吾安排一切？","id":131,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":132},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"……因为，我见过您没有见过的东西。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":134},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"陛下留在都城里，就是对民心和士气最好的鼓舞。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"如今的泡影国需要您。","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你总是这样。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"梓兰小姐，请你留在都城中协助陛下。","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":144},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"不用你说我也打算这么做。","id":145,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":146},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"但是，你确定那个地点的地层一定能被炸开吗？万一失败，诱饵部队就会被兽潮彻底淹没。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":148},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"我相信斑弥罗。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b5/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":150},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"我也可以帮忙！","id":151,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":152},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……空爆确实是眼下最强的单兵战力。月见夜，你带上她，还有义经，一切按你的计划行事。","id":153,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1049_catap2_1#1$2","focus":"m","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"空爆","text":"收到！","id":155,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1049_catap2_1-1$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyD_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":156},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_dog_voice1","volume":"0.8","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"义经","text":"（充满战意的吼叫）","id":158},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"政宗，你和我留下，协助陛下守城。","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4215_buddyC_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$MHR_cat_voice1","volume":"1","id":162},{"type":"dialogue","name":"政宗","text":"没问题喵！我会看好陛下的喵！","id":163},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":164},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"月见夜。","id":165,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":166},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"臣在。","id":167,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/bf/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":168},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……活着回来。","id":169,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b9/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2101_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":170},{"type":"dialogue","name":"月见夜","text":"好。","id":171,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_2101_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":172},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"dialog","id":176},{"type":"charslot","id":177},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_bg_71_g2_impermanence_room.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":181},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$drift_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act9d0d0/m_avg_drift_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":182,"musicid":1},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":183},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordwhoosh","volume":"1","id":184},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":185},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":186},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":187},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":188},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordwhoosh","volume":"1","id":189},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":190},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"false","id":191},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"20","ystrength":"20","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":193},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"……","id":194,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"呃，陛下，我知道你现在心情很不爽。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":197},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"但是能不能不要在我家里空挥？","id":198,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":199},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"吾在宫里待不下去。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"在我家里就会心情愉快点吗？！","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2100_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":203},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宝巫迦","text":"你和月见夜关系不差，看着你挥，会让吾解气一点。","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/31/Avg_avg_npc_2100_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"我和那家伙关系可算不上好。","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"charslot","id":208},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":209},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","duration":"1","id":210},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我也觉得奇怪，堂堂月见夜将军，为什么好像只跟你关系还不错？","id":212,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"为什么你也理所当然地出现在我家，我家是什么游乐园吗？！","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":215},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我在宫里也有点待不下去，剩下认识的地方也只有这里了。","id":216,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":217},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"啧。","id":218,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":219},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"十年前，我还是个学徒，那家伙也只是前代陛下的跟屁虫。","id":220,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"我的师父加入了前代陛下的远征队，因为被受“诅咒”的野兽袭击死了，前代陛下后来也失踪了。","id":222,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"从那之后，他就时不时会来找我，还美其名曰同病相怜。哼，我是不觉得有什么同病相怜。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"你不恨“雷之主”？","id":226,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":227},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"恨啊，所以我才一直在研究新的装备，等着有一天有人用我做的武器杀了“雷之主”。","id":228,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#3$1","focus":"m","id":229},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"……原来你是认真的？","id":230,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/17/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"我从来也没说过我不是认真的，只是大家都不相信罢了。","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2103_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"斑弥罗","text":"也只有月见夜那家伙会一直鼓励我，但也就这样了，他会帮我，我却帮不上他，这算不上朋友。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_npc_2103_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":235},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"朋友可不是这么算的。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"走吧，宝巫迦，总是待在这里也不是办法。","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1048_orchd2_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"梓兰","text":"我们一起去看看外面有没有什么需要帮助的地方。","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2a/Avg_avg_1048_orchd2_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":242},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":243},{"type":"bgeffect","id":244},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":245},{"type":"image","id":246},{"type":"charslot","id":247}],"characters":["武士","宝巫迦","月见夜","梓兰","空爆","政宗","义经","斑弥罗"]}